        <object id="system" label="&lt;b&gt;Good Deeds&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[Software system]&lt;br&gt;Mobile-responsive web app: a feed of good deeds witnessed by others, Bangalore launch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Today (M0+M1): accounts, phone OTP, consent, profiles, QR&lt;/i&gt;" status="implemented" milestone="M1" source="docs/PRD.md#1; backend/app/main.py; backend/app/modules/registry.py; frontend/src/app/routes.tsx" details="Only the identity module is registered. Deeds, feed, scoring etc. are M2-M8.">
